sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant P as Service portal
    participant F as Freshdesk API
    participant R as Automation rules
    actor A as Maintenance agent

    S->>P: Submit "Toilet blocked on 3rd floor"
    P->>F: POST /api/v2/tickets (no type, no group)
    F->>R: Ticket creation rules run
    R-->>F: Type=Maintenance, Group=Maintenance, Status=Assigned
    F-->>P: 201 {id: 42}
    P->>F: GET /tickets/42
    F-->>P: group, type, priority, status
    P-->>S: Ticket 42 · Maintenance · Assigned (routed in about 1 s)
    F-->>A: Email: new ticket in your group
    A->>F: Set status In Progress
    F->>P: Webhook {ticket_id: 42, status: In Progress}
    F-->>S: Email: your report is In Progress
    A->>F: Set status Resolved
    F->>P: Webhook {status: Resolved}
    S->>P: Track ticket 42
    P-->>S: Open → Assigned → In Progress → Resolved
